# default owner
*       @acme/default

# last-match-wins: docs override the default
docs/   @acme/docs

# directory pattern
/internal/billing/   @acme/platform @acme/finance

# ** recursion
src/**/*.go   @acme/go-developers

# a gap with no owner
scripts/tmp/

# email owner
*.legal.md   legal@acme.com
